==Non-passenger plates==
Multi-purpose vehicles (such as [[minivan]]s and [[sport utility vehicle]]s), as well as [[pickup truck]]s and cargo vans, have traditionally been issued separate plate types. However, since June 14, 2010, trucks and multi-purpose vehicles have been issued passenger plates with the same serial format, first on the War of 1812 commemorative base and currently on the "Maryland Proud" base.

